�Me trupheroteta kai thlipse, me pikria kai orge, e Maria katathetei te dike tes ekdokhe tou sugklonistikou gegonotos pou uperxe kathoristiko toso gia ten idia oso kai gia ten anthropoteta. Gerasmene, kataponemene kai exoriste, e Maria agnoei ten parametro anthropoteta. Gia ekeine metraei to oti to paidi tes pethane me tropo sklero kai apanthropo gia enan aprodioristo skopo, se mia epokhe allagon kai anakatataxeon.
Kathos e zoe tes ekhei arkhisei na pairnei muthikes diastaseis, e Maria apophasizei na milesei. Mesa apo te sparaktike aphegese ton gegonoton anaduetai okhi monon e tragike morphe tes meteras alla kai e morphe tes gunaikas pou askei me to idio ethos kai austeroteta ten kritike kai ten autokritike.
E diatheke tes Marias etan ste brakheia lista tou brabeiou Mpouker gia to 2013 kai ekhei anebei me megale epitukhia se theatrike skene tou Londinou.
Kritikes gia to biblio:
To muthistorema auto einai e ekdokhe tes Parthenou Marias gia te zoe tou Khristou. Aphou mia zoe oloklere akouge tis ekdokhes olon ton allon gi' aute te zoe, e Maria ekdelonei to thumo kai ten apogoeteuse tes, theorontas oti einai oles amphisbetesimes.(Irish Independent)
Tolmero kai polu sugkinetiko. (John Banville "Books of the Year", Irish Times)
E kataponemene Maria tou Tompin, gemate skeptikismo kai mnesikakia, moiazei polu pio alethine kai geine apo ten eusebe, aionia partheno tou thrulou.O Tompin einai exairetikos suggrapheas: opos panta e lurike kai sugkinetike proza tou einai to alethino thauma". (Naomi Alderman, Observer)
Me ten paraplanetika lite graphe tou o Tompin parousiazei ten istoria tes Parthenou Marias san mia istoria anthropines apoleias kai okhi san mia istoria lutroses. Gia te Maria tou Tompin den niothoume eukola eulabeia, mporoume omos eukola na tautistoume mazi tes.(Metro)
O Tompin katathetei ena entuposiako ergo threskeutikes phantasias....exairetika prototupo, apo ta keimena pou duskola xekhniountai. (TLS)"�
�Oi eroes auton ton diegematon, stratiotes pou polemesan ste mikrasiatike ekstrateia, erkhontai antimetopoi me tous rolous pou tous epiballoun oi paradosiakoi kanones kai to bioma tou polemou. Sugkrouontai, upotassontai, zoun en krupto e pheugoun. To gkiak einai to aima, o suggenikos desmos kai o nomos tou aimatos pou skiazei tis zoes tous. Me enan trakhu prophoriko logo, oi istories tou aphegountai ten apoleia prosanatolismou, ten adunamia tous na sumbibasoun tous kodikes tes paradoses me ta sunaisthemata kai te suneidese tous."�
�O Argures Liodes oute ste mese tou pouthena, dikhos xena aphtia paronta, mporouse na phonaxei ta onomata ton exi, na tous simosei mazemenous, na tous koitaxei epitelous katamata, gia na labei te duname kai na tolmesei esto duo logia gia ta xera gegonota.
Duo logia gia ta xera gegonota den epikheirese oute se argoporemenes epistoles, giati sto parelthon opote lipopsukhouse kai ethele natous ta grapsei, telika lipopsukhouse kai sten idea tou grammenou khartiou.
Tha tou eleipan kai ta blemmata tous molis mathainan, ki autos eikhe ten elpida kai ten anagke na kourniasei sta matia tous.
Alla epi eikosi ennia khronia exi alla zeugaria matia ton empodizan, ola skoteines kopies tou sumbolaiou me tis ephta, mazi me te dike tou, upographes, na men patethei o orkos siopes ekeines tes nukhtas."�

�
1999: O Khari Khole purobolei logo parexegeses enan amerikano mustiko praktora ste diarkeia tes episkepses tou proedrou Klinton ste Norbegia. Eno perimenei ten tapeinotike apopompe tou apo to astunomiko soma, o Khole metatithetai sten antitromokratike kai pairnei proagoge - ginetai epitheoretes. Ton khonoun se ena aneliago grapheio kai xephullizei anaphores gia phainomenika asemantes upotheseis. E periptose pou pephtei sta kheria tou omos ekhei idiaitero endiapheron: enas spanios kai asunethistos tupos oplou, to opoio endeiknutai gia ekteleseis, eisagetai lathraia ste Norbegia. Akolouthontas te diadrome tou, o Khari tha brethei antimetopos me ton kosmo tou lathremporiou oplon, ton norbegon Neonazi, alla kai me te zopherotere ptukhe tes norbegikes istorias - te sunergasia ton Norbegon me ton Khitler sto Anatoliko Metopo ste diarkeia tou B' Pagkosmiou polemou. Parallela enas dolophonos apophasismenos na apodosei dikaiosune skorpaei ton thanato...
"Enas apo tous pio sunarpastikous epitheoretes ste sugkhrone astunomike logotekhnia". ("Library Journal")
"Auto to biblio khresimopoiei ta pathe tou parontos gia na sterixei ena akros anesukhetiko epikheirema: otan phimonoume ten istoria, einai san na ten prokaloume na epanalephthei... Ena kalogrammeno kai poluepipedo thriler".
("New York Times Book Review")"�

�
Spanies stigmes alethines omorphias mesa apo uperokhes selides logotekhnias, me exupno khioumor, euaisthesia kai agape gia te zoe, se mia aristourgematike aphegese me duo prosopa:
"To onoma mou einai Rene. Eimai penenta tessaron khronon, khera, mikrosome, stroumpoule kai askheme. Ta teleutaia eikosi ephta khronia eimai e thuroros tou ktiriou sten odo Gkrenel 7, enos omorphou megarou, pou khorizetai se okto megala uperpolutele diamerismata. De spoudasa, emoun pantote phtokhe, diakritike kai asemante. Antapokrinomai omos teleia se o,ti e koinonia pisteuei os upodeigma thurorou polukatoikias* kaneis den mporei na antilephthei oti gnorizo polu perissotera apo tous plousious alazones".
"To onoma mou einai Paloma. Eimai dodeka khronon kai meno sten odo Gkrenel 7, s' ena arkhontiko diamerisma. Entoutois, para ten kalotukhia kai ta ploute, apo polu kairo xero oti o telikos proorismos mou einai e guala me ta psaria. Pos to gnorizo; Tukhainei na eimai exupne. Exairetika exupne, malista. Gi' auto ekho parei ten apophase mou* sto telos tes skholikes khronias, te mera ton genethlion mou, stis 16 Iouniou, th' autoktoneso".
Duo eroides diaphoretikes metaxu tous, me krummenous esoterikous kosmous kai aneipota mustika, pou tha apokaluphthoun me ten aphixe tou kuriou Ozou, enos kalliergemenou kai plousiou Giaponezou."�
�Berolino, 1934
Kathos e pole proetoimazetai na philoxenesei tous Olumpiakous Agones tou 1936, oi Ebraioi apokleiontai apo olous tous germanikous athletikous omilous.
E anakalupse duo ptomaton emplekei ton ntetektib Mperni Gkounter ste zoe duo enoikon tou xenodokheiou Antlon: mias panemorphes aristeres demosiographou, e opoia prospathei na proothesei ten idea tou mpoikotaz tes Olumpiadas apo tis EPA, kai enos gkangkster, pou epidiokei na khresimopoiesei tous agones gia na ploutisei o idios kai e Maphia tou Sikago.
O Mperni tha apokalupsei enan terastio mekhanismo pou drasteriopoieitai sto khoro ton kataskeuon kai tes eureses phtenon ergatikon kherion, skhediasmeno etsi oste na ekmetalleutei ta terastia posa pou einai etoimoi na xodepsoun oi Nazi prokeimenou na kanoun epideixe dunames tes neas Germanias."�

�
Ste boreia methoriake gramme, dipla sta <>pou perpatoun oi prosphuges diaskhizontas ta Balkania me proorismo ten kentrike Europe, droun ta mele tes akrodexias organoses <>. Biaioi, enoploi, me stoles parallages, ekhoun os eroa kai protupo tous ton aimatobammeno arkhego ethnikistikes antartikes omadas tou 1941-44 Prodromo Arslanoglou, ton eponomazomeno Arslan aga.
Apenanti tous tha brethei mia gunaika suggrapheas, e opoia apokaluptei tis agriotetes pou diepraxe o eroas tous kai upenthumizei ten opisthodromese pou ephere os demarkhos sten periokhe. Tha katapherei telika na sosei apo te lethe ten istoria; Tha mporesei na antimetopisei te <>, ten topike koinonia, alla kai mia monastike adelphoteta pou, energopoiontas ta pio skotadistika antanaklastika, prospathei na epibalei ton Arslanoglou kai san agio; Tha brethoun dunameis gia na te sterixoun apenanti se apophasismenous phanatikous, pou salpizoun epistrophe sto skoteino parelthon gia na sothei to ethnos apo ten pagkosmiopoiese;
Mesa se mia phuse orgiastike kai epithetike, sto leuko phonto tou khioniou, ekei opou epiterountai ta perasmata alla kai e anthropine zoe, xediplonetai enas agrios khoros egklematon kai bias, khamenon agonon kai dolion skhedion.
Tha uparxei, arage, antistase apenanti se osous etoimazoun ena aurio pou mono akuro mporei na phantazei gia olous mas;"�
�O Mpeket daneisteke ton titlo apo ena muthistorema tou Tourgkenieph kai demiourgese kati entelos diaphoretiko, ena ergo apaisiodoxo pou enokhlei kai klonizei ton anagnoste, poietiko kai gkrotesko sunama. O anagnostes dekhetai apanota khtupemata, pernaei apo to khamogelo sto morphasmo me mia mono phrase, me phonto to paralogo.
Ston "Proto erota" enas andras anapolei te niote tou me aphorme ten episkepse tou ston tapho tou patera tou kai aphegeitai pos gnorise mia gunaika s'ena pagkaki kai te thuellode skhese tous.
"Baltheka na paizo me tis krauges opos peripou eikha paixei me to tragoudi, prokhorontas, stamatontas, prokhorontas, stamatontas, an mporei kaneis na to pei auto paikhnidi. Oso prokhorousa den tis akouga, khare sto thorubo ton bematon mou. Alla molis stamatousa tis akouga xana, sigoura kathe phora pio khameles, alla ti ki an mia krauge einai khamele e dunate; Auto pou khreiazetai einai na stamatesei. Gia khronia pisteua pos tha stamatousan. Tora pia den to pisteuo. Tha mou khreiazontan ki alloi erotes, isos. Alla ton erota den ton paraggelnei kaneis".
Autos o glukopikros monologos einai apo ta prota keimena pou egrapse o suggrapheas sta gallika, to 1945.
Ta erga tou Mpeket stoikheiothetoun te philosophia tes arneses mesa apo kharakteres pou briskontai antimetopoi me ten anousia kai paraloge uparxe tous khoris ten paregoria tes threskeias, tou muthou e ton philosophikon dogmaton. Kurios ta diegemata tou, pou sukhna ta perigraphoun os apospasmata para os istories, marturoun ton lito tropo pou khresimopoiei te glossa kai ten oikonomia tes ekphrases, kai to poso entona zographizei tis eikones tes apoxenoses kai tou paralogou gia na parousiasei aletheies adesmeutes apo kathe lektiko kallopismo."�
�"Prin polla khronia zouse sto Tsoukhnobo enas antras onomati Mentel Singker. Etan eulabikos, theoseboumenos kai sunethismenos, enas Ebraios san olous..."
Etsi xekina o Rot to muthistorema tou gia ten apoleia tes pistes kai ta basana tou anthropou. O sugkhronos Iob dokimazetai sta gketo tes tsarikes Rosias kai ustera stous aneleetous dromous tes Neas Uorkes. O Mentel Singker khanei ten oikogeneia tou, arrostainei baria kai pephtei thuma skleres metakheirises. Khreiazetai ena thauma...
- Den thelo na kapso ena mono spiti, den thelo na kapso enan monon anthropo. Tha ta khasete, an sas po ti eikha kata nou na kapso. Tha ta khasete kai tha peite: trelatheke ki o Mentel, san ten kore tou. Alla sas bebaiono: den eimai trelos. Trelos emoun. Pano apo exenta khronia emoun trelos, semera den eimai.
- Pes mas, loipon, ti theleis na kapseis!
- Ton Theo! Thelo na kapso ton Theo!
Einai adunaton na perigrapso ton lepto poietiko logo autou tou bibliou, egguomai omos gia tis ekplektikes logotekhnikes aretes tou.
(Thomas Mann)
Etan anamenomeno oti tha diabaza ton Iob tou Rot me endiapheron: Ektimesa ta kharismata tou Rot ede apo ta prota erga tou, kai to teleutaio biblio tou me xaphniase pragmatika, idios khare stous zestous tonous pou emploutisan ten paleta tou suggraphea.
(Robert Musil)
E zoe autou tou kathemerinou anthropou mas aporropha, san na graphei kapoios gia te dike mas zoe, tis dikes mas prosdokies, tous dikous mas agones. E glossa tou Rot ekhei ten peitharkhia kai te duname tes klasikes germanikes logotekhnias. Ena spoudaio kai suntaraktiko biblio, pou kaneis den tha mporesei na to agnoesei.
(Ernst Toller)
O Rot etan politistiko mnemeio ton Ebraion tes Galikias: eironikos, sumponetikos, apoluta suntonismenos me ten katastrophike epokhe opou ezese.
(Harold Bloom)
To ergo tou Giozeph Rot einai sto sunolo tou mia tragedie humaine, e opoia sphurelateitai me tis tekhnikes tes sugkhrones logotekhnias.
(Nadine Gordimer)
Isos na men uparkhei allos sugkhronos logotekhnes pou na sunduazei me megalutere maestria ton muthistorematiko kai ton poietiko logo, ton eurosto, aphtharto realismo me dunates analampes metaphoras kai paromoioses.
(James Wood)
Opoios paradothei ste sugkinese pou proxenei auto to biblio, as men to ekhei baros ste suneidese tou: ekeino pou ton suntaraxe etan e themite epidrase tes anotheutes megales tekhnes.
(Lion Feucht Wanger)"�
�Enas monakhikos andras agorazei ena kainourgo piano ki upographontas ten apodeixe paralabes tou kanei ena lathos -upographei me allo onoma. Ena onoma omos pou tou einai teleios agnosto kai malista anekei se gunaika. Se mia markesia. Ki etsi arkhizei e anazetese autes tes musteriodous agnostes gunaikas, pou prokeitai na metatrepsei te zoe tou se kolase, giati...
<<... giati, oraia ola auta, alla o monakhikos andras den einai o opoiosdepote. Eimai ego. Kai den phantazeste poso basanistiko einai na striphogurna diarkos sto mualo sou ena onoma, enos anthropou pou pote den ekheis sunantesei, akousei e gnorisei, kai pou omos e tziphra tou kataphere na glistresei ap' to kheri sou. Gi' auto, sas parakalo, boetheste me... den tha ethela na gino enokhletikos... alla mepos to onoma "Markesia ntu Mpole" sas leei tipote; Okhi, e; Krima. Delade eiste sigouroi; Mepos to ekhete dei pouthena sto dromo, se kamia aphisa theatrike parastases, sto sinema; Oute, lete. Mepos tote to 'khete diabasei sten egkuklopaideia, se kanena biblio istorias, se kanena logotekhniko biblio; Etan mepos to onoma kapoias erotikes tainias pou eidate prosphata sto binteo e kamia kainourgia opera; A, den blepete porno. Khilia suggnome. Ki oute sas aresei e opera. Den sas adiko... omos prospatheste na thumetheite, na me boethesete... giati, an ten xerete ki eseis aute te markesia, an ekhete esto akousei to onoma tes, isos oi duo mas na gnorizomaste, na eimaste philoi apo palia... gi' auto epitrepste mou na sas diegetho ten istoria mou. Isos na sas boethesei. Loipon pou lete, ola arkhisan m' auto to anathematismeno piano...""�
�"E Eremos ton Tartaron" einai ena ergo pou ekhei diabastei ki agapethei polu s' ole ten Europe. (Mono sten Italia, apo to 1975 ekhei sumplerosei deka epta ekdoseis).
Ta themata tes zoes kai tou thanatou, tes anamones kai tes outopias, tes kathemerinotetas kai tou oneirou, tes niotes kai ton gerateion diapernoun to ergo m' ena uphos pou isorropei diarkos anamesa sto realismo kai te phantasia, anamesa sten perigraphe ton kathemerinon tes zoes kai ten allegorike tous ekphrase.
O basikos tou eroas, o Tziobani Ntrogko, einai o aionios anthropos, einai o kathenas apo mas, kai e "peripeteia" tou, e aionia anthropine peripeteia, e dike mas moira.
"E Eremos ton Tartaron" - autos o phantasiakos khoros, ekei, sten eskhatia tou oneirou, pera apo oria topou kai khronou - einai o khoros opou paizetai e paraloge tragodia tou anthropinou pepromenou."�	
�Ena periergo telephonema diakoptei ten kathemerinoteta enos suggraphea. E musteriodes gunaikeia phone sten alle akre tes grammes tou leei oti oi MakGkaphin theloun na ton proskalesoun se deipno gia na tou apokalupsoun te luse sto musterio tou sumpantos.
Suntoma th' anakalupsei oti prokeitai gia mia prosklese summetokhes sten Ntokoumenta tou Kasel, te thrulike ekthese sugkhrones tekhnes. E apostole tou suggraphea tha einai na kathisei na graphei kathe proi se ena kineziko estiatorio sta proastia tes poles, metatrepontas ton eauto tou se mia zontane kallitekhnike egkatastase.
Sto Kasel, o suggrapheas diapistonei ekplektos oti e psukhologia tou den pephtei otan sourouponei kai oti, antithetos, ton plemmurizei e aisiodoxia otan kanei peripato, dioti ton parasurei e asteireute energeia pou kanei ten kardia tes ektheses na khtupa. Einai e authormete kai euphantaste apantese tes tekhnes pou orthonei anastema mprosta ten apaisiodoxia.
Me khioumor, embritheia kai kophtere matia, o Enrique Vila-Matas, o koruphaios suggrapheas ton sugkhronon ispanikon grammaton, mas apokaluptei ten ousia tes logotekhnias kai ton pragmatiko logo tes suggraphes."	333333@"	H�z�G@"	R���Q@"	ffffff@"	q=
